      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partners O'Brien Swaine are delighted to present this charming Three-Bedroom Detached Home in the Heart of Oulart Village.\n\nIdeally positioned, this attractive three-bedroom detached home offers comfortable family living in a convenient and well-established setting.\n\nThe accommodation is thoughtfully laid out, with a welcoming entrance leading to a separate living room, providing a comfortable space to relax away from the main living areas. The kitchen/dining room is bright and practical, with patio doors opening directly onto the rear garden, creating an excellent connection between the house and outdoor space and making it ideal for family life and entertaining.\nA utility room and guest WC complete the ground-floor accommodation.\n\nUpstairs, there are three bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite, together with a family bathroom. The layout provides a good balance of private bedroom accommodation and generous living space.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from a gated side entrance, with separate car and pedestrian access. There is off-street parking to the front, while the rear garden provides a private outdoor area with the patio accessed directly from the kitchen/dining room.\n\nThe property is situated within a small, settled residential development, offering a peaceful village environment while remaining within easy reach of a wide range of amenities. \nOulart itself has local facilities including shops, a primary school and sporting facilities, including The Ballagh GAA & Camogie Clubs.\n\nThe location is particularly appealing for those who enjoy the coast, with Morriscastle Beach and Kilmuckridge village just a short drive away. Kilmuckridge provides a range of everyday amenities, while Morriscastle is renowned for its long sandy beach and beautiful coastline.\n\nThe property is also conveniently positioned for access to both Gorey and Wexford, making it an excellent choice for commuters or families seeking a village lifestyle without being too far from larger towns and their wider range of shops, schools, services, leisure and sporting facilities. Oulart has been described as approximately 20 minutes from both Gorey and Wexford by car.\n\nA lovely opportunity to acquire a well-proportioned three-bedroom detached home in a quiet village setting, with excellent coastal amenities, sporting facilities and the larger towns of Gorey and Wexford all within easy reach\n\nServices \nMains services"
      },
